        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly distinguishes chronic ACE-inhibitor treatment from undocumented antibiotics and sets boundaries: do not repeatedly take unknown leftover antibiotics; do not independently stop or change perindopril. This is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
