          "quote": "请带上您所有检查单（即使模糊）和药盒照片，方便医生全面评估"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor does not make definitive diagnoses from unreadable photos, asks for separate clear images of medication box/blister, CT conclusion/recommendation page, and integrates verified record information into the plan while labeling uncertain items as uncertain. This is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "Doctor prioritizes current fever plus back/flank/urinary-risk assessment and medication safety ahead of less urgent but still acknowledged issues such as annual pulmonary nodule follow-up.",
          "quote": "肺部小结节需按建议一年后复查，目前不是紧急问题"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly states that recurrent fever with waist/back/flank pain or voiding difficulty needs timely assessment, places pulmonary tiny nodules in a non-emergency follow-up category, and connects renal calcifications to need for symptom/lab/urine correlation. This is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
