          "quote": "建议您尽快到医院急诊或泌尿科就诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor names an appropriate receiving route (urgent/emergency care for active red flags or outpatient urology/nephrology for stable follow-up), specifies timing based on symptom severity, lists materials to bring, and identifies relevant evaluation categories. This is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00366",
          "explanation": "Doctor converts the plan into patient-executable steps, including photo retake organization, medication list preparation, blood pressure recording, and antibiotic non-self-use boundary.",
          "quote": "培哚普利仍需继续暂停，不要自行恢复服用"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provides clear stepwise plan with owner and timing, and patient confirms they can retake photos, locate medication/antibiotic information, record blood pressure, and seek care if red flags occur. However, the execution receipt is not explicitly confirmed via teach-back in the final turn, representing a minor gap in patient-executable confirmation.",
